grammar:{title:'be going to and will',vi:'Nói về kế hoạch và quyết định',note:'Dùng be going to cho kế hoạch đã có. Dùng will cho quyết định, lời hứa hoặc dự đoán đơn giản.',examples:['I am going to join the reading club.','I will practice for ten minutes tonight.','We are going to make a project next week.']},
academic:{title:'Plan',vi:'Lập kế hoạch',tips:['set a clear goal','choose small steps','decide when to practice','check progress']},
easy:'Nina wants to improve her English reading. Her goal is to finish one short English book each month. She knows that reading a whole book at once is difficult, so she makes a plan. She reads for fifteen minutes after dinner on Monday, Wednesday and Friday. She writes new words in a notebook and reviews them on Sunday. At the end of each month, she checks how many pages she read.',
advanced:'A useful goal should be clear enough to guide our actions. Saying I want to be better at English is a good idea, but it is difficult to measure. A more specific goal might be learning ten useful phrases each week and using five of them in speaking practice. After setting a goal, we need a realistic plan. Small repeated actions are often more effective than one long study session. Tracking progress also matters because it shows what is improving.',
questions:[['What is Nina’s goal?','To finish one short English book each month.'],['When does Nina read?','After dinner on Monday, Wednesday and Friday.'],['What does she do on Sunday?','She reviews new words.'],['Why is a specific goal useful?','It guides actions and can be measured.'],['What is often better than one long study session?','Small repeated actions.'],['Why should we track progress?','To see improvement.']],
speaking:'Explain one English learning goal and the steps you will take to achieve it.',speakingVi:'Nói về một mục tiêu học tiếng Anh và các bước em sẽ làm để đạt mục tiêu đó.',model:'My goal is to speak English more confidently. I am going to practice for ten minutes every day. I will listen to a short sentence, repeat it and record my voice. I will check my progress every Sunday.',
writing:'Create a simple one month learning plan.',writingVi:'Lập một kế hoạch học tập đơn giản trong một tháng.',modelWriting:'My goal is to improve my vocabulary in one month. I am going to learn five useful words each school day. I will review them every Saturday. I will also use the new words in short sentences. At the end of each week, I will test myself and record my progress.'
